/*
  TelemetryPipelineCard.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0256 · TelemetryPipelineCard (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  TelemetryPipelineCard resolves (table "TelemetryPipelineCard") lives here with its web
  English value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at
  integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt
  owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The web source (features/system/components/status/TelemetryPipelineCard.tsx) is anonymous
  — it has no `t()` calls — so these keys are minted here under the `telemetry.pipeline.*`
  namespace, each carrying the verbatim English copy from the web source so the native
  surface reads identically and stays fully localizable.
*/

